; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset 02_Trend_Continuation_Momentum
; Trend + momentum + volume expansion
; family: trend | hard filters: InpTrendFilterMode, InpSTUse, InpMACDMode, InpVolFilterMode, InpUseSlopeFilter
; The direction must be confirmed by two independent trend measurements (higher timeframe EMA and the SuperTrend) and the move must be backed by momentum (MACD histogram) and by rising participation (relative volume above 1.2x). The EMA regime, the 55/45 RSI levels and the slope only add score, because they measure the same thing the two trend filters already measure.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

